  "scope_notes": [
    "Real current OECD 2016-2020 release, isolated PostgreSQL, local Nginx HTTP -> Uvicorn TCP; no production TLS/HTTP2 or campus network simulation.",
    "Server wrapper adds a localhost-only metrics route and CPU invocation counts; production application contains no metrics/test route. Scheduling limits and operations are real.",
    "Bootstrap waits for health readiness; one request set before readiness returned 502 and was discarded.",
    "Raw same-year 50-column test uses one authenticated read-only account. Five-year cold/warm test, natural bootstrap, saves, CAS, cancellation, regression, report phases use 50 independent student accounts.",
    "Cold means empty application cache; OS page cache was not flushed.",
    "Report fixture is populated via public APIs and cloned to 50 session owners with individual research-question suffixes. Four prescribed regression diagnostics are invalid_design, accepted as reportable diagnostic evidence; timing does not cover every possible inferential result.",
    "Distinct jobs use legal API seeds at n_draws=40; stock UI uses a fixed seed. Cold identical UI parameter test used a new API process and observed one computation.",
    "Client-disconnect lifecycle tests use real HTTP cancellations through Nginx; ordinary read/write probes use independent clients to avoid load-generator pool queueing.",
    "No production service was deployed or modified. Temporary local resources are cleaned after verification."
  ],
